        "text_preview": "If the so called grounds of detention are to be accepted to be making a sense, then surely the petitioner would have suffered implication in some reported incidents endangering the law and order situation lest that of public disorder but wi"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "502a17a6e6b840fcbde228a3e01a70c5_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n9. A seriously eroding fact with respect to the detention order passed by the respondent No.\n"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5d40798cdf25441aa389c3a69153ab2c_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "is that the petitioner's unrevealed, undisclosed and unknown activities have been purportedly held to be prejudicial to the Security of the State whereas in the Jammu & Kashmir Public Safety Act, 1978 in terms of its section 8 there is no s"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a1b73aedfcba40e79dd1f4434eeddb90_22",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The security of the State of J&K used to be a ground for preventive detention of a person under the Act but ceased to be so w.e.f 31/03/2020 vide S.O.1229(E) of 2020 dated 31/03/2020 whereby it is now only with respect to and by reference t"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f004b2531d54486f9678ba914039be0b_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. Thus the respondent No. 3-District Magistrate Anantnag was acting without jurisdiction in ordering the preventive detention of the petitioner by reference to \"the Security of the State\" basis."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2963e7be966b444da689b2e3a63ede24_24",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
