            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 189,
            "end": 196
          },
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 218,
            "end": 225
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "11. Thus, the preventive detention of the petitioner by virtue of the impugned order dated 29/06/2022 is legally untenable and as a result whereof the petitioner's detention deserves to be quashed and is, accordingly, quashed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2307c58bc7dd4f4a8d87592094b3faf8_25",
